## Cost Breakdown at Scale

| Users | D1 reads/mo | D1 writes/mo | D1 cost | PG savings |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1,000 | ~10M | ~2M | $0.50 | -60% PG load |
| 100,000 | ~1B | ~200M | $5 | -85% PG load |
| 1,000,000 | ~10B | ~2B | $50 | -95% PG load |

D1 pricing: first 25B reads free, $0.001/M after. First 50M writes free, $1/M after.
At 1M users, the $50/mo D1 cost replaces $500+/mo of PostgreSQL read scaling.
